# Void graphics locked

Cluster Integration → Void visuals are locked. Do not change them unless the user explicitly asks to restyle the void.

Locked look (in `components/site/cluster-assembly-layer.tsx` VoidVolume / VOID_* shaders):

- Teal `#0f7377` and orange `#c77e5f` only
- Color follows form (bumps / slopes), not a ground-up height gradient
- No white contour lines, no rim glow, no grey mesh edges
- Dense, nearly solid opacity

Allowed without unlocking graphics:

- Clearance / no-touch gap so void never intersects solids
- Void generation accuracy (domain, footprints, ground-up fill under overhangs)
- Cache version bumps for mesh regeneration
